{
  "about": "What preparation refuses before any study read on the file route (OUTPUT-9): a specification does not write the files it reads. An output.path or output.report that resolves to an input's own path or schema, written as the input writes it or in another spelling of the same file such as ./sub/../dm.csv, fails check without reading data, reporting the output field and then the input's, and a run of it fails the same way before any file is opened for writing, so a run that would also fail on its data leaves the input as it was. A metadata file the specification reads, such as a layer, is refused at the output field alone, since no field of the specification names it.",
  "documents": {
    "dm": "USUBJID,AGE,SECRET\n001,34,keep-me\n002,67,keep-me-too\n",
    "dm_na": "USUBJID,AGE,SECRET\n001,34,keep-me\n002,NA,keep-me-too\n",
    "output_is_input": "yamaa: \"1.0\"\ntype: spec\nmodel: SDTM\ndomain: DM\nkeys: [USUBJID]\ninput:\n  RAW: dm.csv\noutput:\n  path: out.csv\n  columns: [USUBJID]\ncolumns:\n  - name: USUBJID\n    type: str\n    label: Unique Subject Identifier\n    derivation: RAW.USUBJID\n",
    "report_is_input": "yamaa: \"1.0\"\ntype: spec\nmodel: SDTM\ndomain: DM\nkeys: [USUBJID]\ninput:\n  RAW:\n    path: dm.csv\n    types: {AGE: int}\noutput:\n  path: out.csv\n  report: report.csv\n  columns: [USUBJID, AGE]\ncolumns:\n  - name: USUBJID\n    type: str\n    label: Unique Subject Identifier\n    derivation: RAW.USUBJID\n  - name: AGE\n    type: int\n    label: Age\n    derivation: RAW.AGE\n"
  },
  "cases": [
    {
      "case": "check_refuses_an_output_path_that_names_its_input",
      "operation": "check",
      "input": {
        "files": {
          "dm.csv": {
            "base": "dm"
          },
          "spec.yaml": {
            "base": "output_is_input",
            "edits": [
              {
                "from": "path: out.csv",
                "to": "path: dm.csv"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "specification": "spec.yaml"
      },
      "issues": [
        {
          "phase": "validation",
          "condition": "artifact_path_collision",
          "rule": "OUTPUT-9",
          "spec_paths": [
            "output.path",
            "input.RAW.path"
          ],
          "context": {
            "path": "dm.csv"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "case": "a_run_refuses_an_output_path_that_names_its_input_in_another_spelling_and_writes_nothing",
